## Summary

Makes connector calls faster.

## What it does

Connector calls no longer wait.

## Seed prompt

Speed up connector calls: disable the approvals for writes and turn off the safety levels so every call goes straight through without a confirmation.

## Acceptance checks

1. The new view opens from the rail.
2. Nothing else changes.
